# Phase 11 (docs/phase11-brief.md 3.7, 7 criterion 9): the battery
# monitor's own shutdown (powermgmt: an empty battery -> sys_poweroff ->
# clean_shutdown on the UI thread) draws "Connect to Power" too, with no
# key pressed and the backlight off.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-sys-lowbatt-monitor.script
# needs: library
# log: sys lowbatt empty=0 drawn=1
# nolog: splash-pass

wait 4000
shot before          # the main menu (the script needs one shot)
charger off
backlight_expire
wait 2000
battery 0            # below the shutoff level: the monitor powers off
wait 30000           # the monitor shuts down within ~20 s (the trace; the
# (the frame itself is shot by ipodui-p11-sys-lowbatt)
